+## 变更范围
+<!-- MACHINE-DRAFT:proposal-scope:c2df93a11e9ca6ee6a663493c18f0859082ad8a26d29740393c2d3d0d99c65fb:begin 机器预填段——整段改写会被 flow done 拒收；确要修改：sillyspec flow amend-draft --change 2026-09-29-batch-tick-gate 留痕重锚 -->
